<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1881] flink-config.yaml is not copied to $MAHOUT_HOME/conf in Binary Distro </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1881</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;tt&gt;$MAHOUT_HOME/flink-config.yaml&lt;/tt&gt; file which is used to configure the Flink degree of parallesm, number of tasks, and temp caching directory is not included in the &lt;tt&gt;$MAHOUT_HOME/conf&lt;/tt&gt; in the binary distribution.  It seems like the whole directory is written over with mr .props files during the release process.  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The file exists in the source repository. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
